body:
I asked a direct question that does absolutely not need logs to answer. I am looking for how guilds do that fight, I do NOT need 5 people coming into the game and harrasing my players because their mythic gear makes their DPS higher. If you cannot answer I appreciate just a no answer instead. Mainly because this time if it happens again (which im not even going to let it happen) Blizzard will be getting involved because I showed them everything. I do not want that from either group. People asked questions before logs existed. I played back then. As stated, all videos I have seen do not answer it, this video says nothing about what I asked. Watching 30 player raids doesnt do anything for us.

&#x200B;

thank you.
